      "for_authoritative_voices_on_maine_wate": " Für maßgebliche Stimmen zur Einzugsgebietsarbeit in Maine konsultiere das Penobscot Nation Cultural and Historic Preservation Department, Wabanaki Public Health and Wellness, Atlantic Salmon Federation, Maine Coast Heritage Trust, Maine Audubon, Maine Soil and Water Conservation Districts, und das Maine Department of Environmental Protection.",
