      "descent_touch_hint": "👆 No keyboard? The same three controls sit along the bottom of the flight view — hold them with a finger or the mouse.",
      "eva_goal_checklist": "Collect at least 4 different rocks and deploy the seismometer. The cuff checklist in the HUD ticks them off, and the 🎯 bearing arrow points to the nearest rock still on the ground.",
