      "mitochondria_are_tiny_organelles_insid": "Mitochondria are tiny organelles inside almost every cell of your body. They take glucose (from carbs) or fatty acids (from fats), combine them with oxygen, and release CO₂ + water — capturing the energy in ATP along the way.",
