      "3_defects_cracks_voids_conductivity_ch": "3. Defects (cracks, voids, conductivity changes) disrupt eddy current flow → impedance of coil changes.",
      "3_defects_in_the_path_also_reflect_sho": "3. Defects in the path also reflect — show up earlier than back surface.",
