      "salary_range": "Salary range: ",
      "saltwater_conducts_equipment_must_be_d": "Saltwater conducts. Equipment must be DC negative polarity, fully insulated, with automatic dead-man cutoff. AC welding underwater is illegal — fatal nearly every time.",
      "same_v_a_ts_controls_above_drive_both_": "— same V/A/TS controls above drive both views",
